cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you refer to results published on DeepECG-Bench, cite the DeepECG-Kit software and name the
  snapshot id you read. Snapshot directories are immutable and carry checksums, so a snapshot id
  identifies an exact set of numbers.
title: "DeepECG-Bench"
abstract: >-
  A catalogue of the architectures registered in DeepECG-Kit and a record of what has been
  measured on each, published as immutable, checksummed result snapshots.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Hicks
    given-names: Steven
    email: steven@simula.no
    affiliation: SimulaMet
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/stevenah/deepecg-kit-bench"
url: "https://stevenah.github.io/deepecg-kit-bench/"
